          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Balak Balaam atiar, “Sirikiken kes nepetai da, karaida ailipakini kes adioreren.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye Koboŋok Balaam Balak ebe, “Mam abu kalimok jo ebe, ‘Kere nuinera EJAKAIT, nupeŋun kebusakinit aswam?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Balak Balaam atiar, “Aso bia, kayana jo aibois ace; elemuni kitojok Edeke jo aikenokin eoŋ kes kaŋina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koyana Balak Balaam aidi naka Peor, neitei amodiŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
